[LINK: (^) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kururin_Squash!#cite_ref-8]   [LINK: (Eighting) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eighting]  (October 14, 2004). Kururin Squash! ( [LINK: (GameCube) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GameCube] ) (in Japanese).  [LINK: (Nintendo) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nintendo] . Scene: Adventure cutscene. Teacher Hare: クリアしたごほうびに、ちょっと変わったヘリリンを持ってきたぞ！ / とくしゅヘリリンその名も「ツルリン」だ！ / つばさがなくてよけやすいんだけどじっと止まることはできないぞ (As a reward for clearing the level, I've brought a slightly unusual Helirin! / The special Helirin is called "Tsururin"! / It doesn't have wings so it's easy to avoid obstacles, but it can't stay still.)

