[LINK: (^) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kururin_Squash!#cite_ref-16]   [LINK: (Eighting) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eighting]  (October 14, 2004). Kururin Squash! ( [LINK: (GameCube) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GameCube] ) (in Japanese).  [LINK: (Nintendo) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nintendo] . Scene: World 1 ending cutscene. Hyokorin and Loverin: おにいちゃーんワタシたち教授につかまっちゃった！(Big brother, we've been caught by the professor!) / Professor Isogashima: 研究のジャマをするからですよ！(Because they're interfering with my research!)

[LINK: (^) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kururin_Squash!#cite_ref-17]   [LINK: (Eighting) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eighting]  (October 14, 2004). Kururin Squash! ( [LINK: (GameCube) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GameCube] ) (in Japanese).  [LINK: (Nintendo) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nintendo] . Scene: World 3 ending cutscene. Gizarin: イソガシステムができると (Once the Isogashima System is created) / Chikurin: みんな、いそがしくなっちゃうって！ (Everyone will become busy!) / Gekirin: いそがしいの、イヤだゲキ！ (I hate being busy!) / [...] / Professor Isogashima: どうせヒマなクセに！はたらきなさーい！ (You have so much free time anyway! Get to work!)

